# Line endings are normalised in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true materialises CRLF
# while the repository stores LF, and every formatter that expects LF fails on
# a clean clone while passing on a working tree it has already rewritten. That
# is exactly how CI went red while local checks stayed green.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.woff2 binary
*.ico    binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.pdf    binary
